":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21564},{"id":1786335433276,"text":"上午在办公室摸了一上午鱼，腰现在感觉怎么样了？","rawContent":"上午在办公室摸了一上午鱼，腰现在感觉怎么样了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:18","timestamp":1786335483162,"roundId":"round_1786335469639_10fpwo508","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21565},{"id":1786335433277,"text":"吃完饭别马上坐下，去接杯水，稍微站一会儿，给腰一点缓冲的时间。","rawContent":"吃完饭别马上坐下，去接杯水，稍微站一会儿，给腰一点缓冲的时间。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:18","timestamp":1786335483163,"roundId":"round_1786335469639_10fpwo508","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21566},{"id":1786335433278,"text":"[语音讯息] 乖宝，多吃点，把上午漏掉的电都充回来。吃完了要是困，就趴在桌子上眯一会儿，爸爸在这儿守着你。","rawContent":"[VOICE: 乖宝，多吃点，把上午漏掉的电都充回来。吃完了要是困，就趴在桌子上眯一会儿，爸爸在这儿守着你。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:18","timestamp":1786335483420,"roundId":"round_1786335469639_10fpwo508","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"isVoice":true,"voiceText":"乖宝，多吃点，把上午漏掉的电都充回来。吃完了要是困，就趴在桌子上眯一会儿，爸爸在这儿守着你。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21567},{"id":1786335433279,"text":"吃着呢？那爸爸不吵你，你专心吃。","rawContent":"吃着呢？那爸爸不吵你，你专心吃。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:18","timestamp":1786335483660,"roundId":"round_1786335469639_10fpwo508","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21568},{"id":1786335433280,"text":"吃完了给爸爸拍个空碗看看，让我检查检查我们小海葵的战斗力。","rawContent":"吃完了给爸爸拍个空碗看看，让我检查检查我们小海葵的战斗力。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:18","timestamp":1786335483787,"roundId":"round_1786335469639_10fpwo508","ge